"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pok%C3%A9mon_Legends%3A_Z-A","asOf":"2026-11-21"},"ar":{"text":"بوكيمون أسطورة ز-أ هيَ لعبة من الجيل التاسِع لبوكيمون أعلنت في فبراير 2024، سوف تصدر في عام 2025 من تطوير شركة غيم فريك وَنشر نينتندو وَ ذا بوكيمون كومباني. تدور أحداث بوكيمون أسطورة ز-أ في قرية لوميوس في كالوس المستلهمة من مدينة باريس، كما حصلَ معَ بوكيمون إكس واي، بوكيمون أسطورة ز-أ هيَ ثاني جزء من سلسلة ليجندز ، أول جزء كان بوكيمون ليجيندز: آركياس.","title":"بوكيمون أسطورة: ز-أ","url":"https://ar.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D8%A8%D9%88%D9%83%D9%8A%D9%85%D9%88%D9%86_%D8%A3%D8%B3%D8%B7%D9%88%D8%B1%D8%A9%3A_%D8%B2-%D8%A3","asOf":"2026-11-21"}}},"pokemon-violet-switch":{"id":"pokemon-violet-switch","developers":[],"series":["Pokémon"]},"princess-farmer-switch":{"id":"princess-farmer-switch","developers":[],"opencriticId":"12997"},"radiation-island-switch":{"id":"radiation-island-switch","developers":[],"opencriticId":"5636"},"remilore-switch":{"id":"remilore-switch","developers":["Criterion Games","Pixellore","REMIMORY"],"opencriticId":"7335"},"sacred-zodongga-defense-switch":{"id":"sacred-zodongga-defense-switch","developers":[]},"skater-xl-switch":{"id":"skater-xl-switch","developers":[],"opencriticId":"9574"},"snakebird-complete-switch":{"id":"snakebird-complete-switch","developers":["Noumenon Games"],"opencriticId":"15900"},"spencer-switch":{"id":"spencer-switch","developers":[]},"summer-valley-hike-switch":{"id":"summer-valley-hike-switch","developers":[]},"super-mutant-alien-assault-switch":{"id":"super-mutant-alien-assault-switch","developers":[],"opencriticId":"3015"},"super-shadow-break-showdown-ninja-vs-the-three-kaijus-switch":{"id":"super-shadow-break-showdown-ninja-vs-the-three-kaijus-switch","developers":[]},"tavern-talk-switch":{"id":"tavern-talk-switch","developers":["Gentle Troll Entertainment"],"opencriticId":"16875"},"the-journey-down-chapter-three-switch":{"id":"the-journey-down-chapter-three-switch","developers":["Skygoblin"],"opencriticId":"5177"},"the-legend-of-bum-bo-switch":{"id":"the-legend-of-bum-bo-switch","developers":["Edmund McMillen","James Id"],"opencriticId":"8597"},"the-legend-of-heroes-trails-of-cold-steel-iii-switch":{"id":"the-legend-of-heroes-trails-of-cold-steel-iii-switch","developers":["Nihon Falcom"],"series":["The Legend of Heroes","The Legend of Heroes: Trails of Cold Steel","Trails"],"opencriticId":"8422"},"the-otterman-empire-switch":{"id":"the-otterman-empire-switch","developers":[]},"tony-hawks-pro-skater-1-and-2-switch":{"id":"tony-hawks-pro-skater-1-and-2-switch","developers":["Beenox","Blizzard Albany"],"series":["Tony Hawk's"],"opencriticId":"9440","wikipedia":{"en":{"text":"Tony Hawk's Pro Skater 1 + 2 is a 2020 skateboarding video game developed by Vicarious Visions and published by Activision. It was released for PlayStation 4, Windows, and Xbox One on September 4, 2020, PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X/S on March 26, 2021, and Nintendo Switch on June 25 of the same year. It is a remake of the first two games in the Tony Hawk's series: Tony Hawk's Pro Skater (1999) and Tony Hawk's Pro Skater 2 (2000), which were originally developed by Neversoft. It was the first major console game in the series since Tony Hawk's Pro Skater 5 (2015) and is Vicarious Visions' final work as a subsidiary of Activision before it was merged into Blizzard Entertainment on January 22, 2021.","title":"Tony Hawk's Pro Skater 1 + 2","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tony_Hawk's_Pro_Skater_1_%2B_2","asOf":"2026-11-21"}}},"true-fear-forsaken-souls-part-2-switch":{"id":"true-fear-forsaken-souls-part-2-switch","developers":["Goblinz"],"series":["True Fear: Forsaken Souls"],"opencriticId":"8666"},"urban-survival-simulator-the-bums-journey-switch":{"id":"urban-survival-simulator-the-bums-journey-switch","developers":["Dezvolt Games"]},"v-rally-4-switch":{"id":"v-rally-4-switch","developers":["Kylotonn"],"series":["V-Rally"],"opencriticId":"6548"},"warlocks-2-god-slayers-switch":{"id":"warlocks-2-god-slayers-swit